    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Perfect Bowl is a cozy, heartfelt narrative Ramen arranger about dealing with grief, following Jim Wada, the new owner of his family\u2019s ramen business. Journey with him as he copes with his father\u2019s illness and helps his customers find comfort in ramen, aiming to heal himself along the way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976790/extras/e8d5b85d6811b2451acaa3600c2f497b.avif?t=1755356758\" width=1560 height=115 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Jim is faced with the certainty of losing his father, the thought of immense guilt and regret pushes him to get pass their estrangement. Watch his story unfold as he tries to rebuild the relationship with his father one photo at a time before its too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976790/extras/e1d4297c7d783937ecfbf3cda9dbb6aa.poster.avif?t=1755356758\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976790/extras/e1d4297c7d783937ecfbf3cda9dbb6aa.webm?t=1755356758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976790/extras/e1d4297c7d783937ecfbf3cda9dbb6aa.mp4?t=1755356758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976790/extras/956abaf21d79620b802ab6d4631bb1fc.avif?t=1755356758\" width=1560 height=115 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're bound to meet some very interesting people working at a wondering ramen cart. Meet the array of quirky characters who seem to be in dire need of some comforting ramen. Uncover their stories and their relationship with ramen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here are some of them:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976790/extras/644648e8e4fcbb7b0150c060ac4c3e7c.avif?t=1755356758\" width=1560 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976790/extras/994f9fc5ca1b31ae9187ecc1c6a68049.avif?t=1755356758\" width=128 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character of the game. Being in his father's shadow has made him timid but he is now forced to break out of his shell. How will he handle the obstacles to come?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976790/extras/72b7f61fa82e9666a783d0734c6ad4d4.avif?t=1755356758\" width=1560 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976790/extras/9e297c446558e4a6e9ad27faac4db72e.avif?t=1755356758\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strict father to Jim with very high expectations. Some may say too strict and too high. Underneath that tough exterior however lies a worried dad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976790/extras/d6e7978fa588d0628770cd358aeaa757.avif?t=1755356758\" width=1560 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976790/extras/203eba6d6d0030147912193208035d4e.avif?t=1755356758\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The commander of the Calor Prison. Young? You could say that but none doubts his ability to lead. He ensures that is subordinates are kept safe but at what cost?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976790/extras/cc3cc84e02c281ee1a853bf1047fbe4e.avif?t=1755356758\" width=1560 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976790/extras/46e14b1c70d47f3d09d11825bded7b7f.avif?t=1755356758\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A VERY colorful and fruity old man with lots of life still left in him. He may be eccentric but he has a good heart and lots of stories to tell.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976790/extras/85aba3d40e5c7482252227008febbc8f.avif?t=1755356758\" width=1560 height=115 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Things work a little different around here. There are no menus for customers to choose from. Instead they strike up a conversation and let Jim work his ramen magic.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976790/extras/23cd01536777b7afb33b62f7f0c776e8.poster.avif?t=1755356758\" width=780 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976790/extras/23cd01536777b7afb33b62f7f0c776e8.webm?t=1755356758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976790/extras/23cd01536777b7afb33b62f7f0c776e8.mp4?t=1755356758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976790/extras/6262827bf0423867745a2d9cad360238.poster.avif?t=1755356758\" width=780 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976790/extras/6262827bf0423867745a2d9cad360238.webm?t=1755356758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976790/extras/6262827bf0423867745a2d9cad360238.mp4?t=1755356758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976790/extras/594ba7a2e335f6de45ae1f3e3e2ddc63.avif?t=1755356758\" width=1560 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself into this cozy environment with a vibe that melts away your walls and readies your soul for a heartfelt story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976790/extras/898eee1ee4d1bea882d0b73dc771a31f.poster.avif?t=1755356758\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976790/extras/898eee1ee4d1bea882d0b73dc771a31f.webm?t=1755356758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976790/extras/898eee1ee4d1bea882d0b73dc771a31f.mp4?t=1755356758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Perfect Bowl is a cozy, heartfelt narrative Ramen arranger about dealing with grief, following Jim Wada, the new owner of his family\u2019s ramen business. Journey with him as he copes with his father\u2019s illness and helps his customers find comfort in ramen, aiming to heal himself along the way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976790/extras/e8d5b85d6811b2451acaa3600c2f497b.avif?t=1755356758\" width=1560 height=115 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Jim is faced with the certainty of losing his father, the thought of immense guilt and regret pushes him to get pass their estrangement. Watch his story unfold as he tries to rebuild the relationship with his father one photo at a time before its too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976790/extras/e1d4297c7d783937ecfbf3cda9dbb6aa.poster.avif?t=1755356758\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976790/extras/e1d4297c7d783937ecfbf3cda9dbb6aa.webm?t=1755356758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976790/extras/e1d4297c7d783937ecfbf3cda9dbb6aa.mp4?t=1755356758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976790/extras/956abaf21d79620b802ab6d4631bb1fc.avif?t=1755356758\" width=1560 height=115 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're bound to meet some very interesting people working at a wondering ramen cart. Meet the array of quirky characters who seem to be in dire need of some comforting ramen. Uncover their stories and their relationship with ramen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here are some of them:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976790/extras/644648e8e4fcbb7b0150c060ac4c3e7c.avif?t=1755356758\" width=1560 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976790/extras/994f9fc5ca1b31ae9187ecc1c6a68049.avif?t=1755356758\" width=128 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character of the game. Being in his father's shadow has made him timid but he is now forced to break out of his shell. How will he handle the obstacles to come?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976790/extras/72b7f61fa82e9666a783d0734c6ad4d4.avif?t=1755356758\" width=1560 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976790/extras/9e297c446558e4a6e9ad27faac4db72e.avif?t=1755356758\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strict father to Jim with very high expectations. Some may say too strict and too high. Underneath that tough exterior however lies a worried dad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976790/extras/d6e7978fa588d0628770cd358aeaa757.avif?t=1755356758\" width=1560 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976790/extras/203eba6d6d0030147912193208035d4e.avif?t=1755356758\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The commander of the Calor Prison. Young? You could say that but none doubts his ability to lead. He ensures that is subordinates are kept safe but at what cost?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976790/extras/cc3cc84e02c281ee1a853bf1047fbe4e.avif?t=1755356758\" width=1560 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976790/extras/46e14b1c70d47f3d09d11825bded7b7f.avif?t=1755356758\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A VERY colorful and fruity old man with lots of life still left in him. He may be eccentric but he has a good heart and lots of stories to tell.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976790/extras/85aba3d40e5c7482252227008febbc8f.avif?t=1755356758\" width=1560 height=115 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Things work a little different around here. There are no menus for customers to choose from. Instead they strike up a conversation and let Jim work his ramen magic.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976790/extras/23cd01536777b7afb33b62f7f0c776e8.poster.avif?t=1755356758\" width=780 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976790/extras/23cd01536777b7afb33b62f7f0c776e8.webm?t=1755356758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared